{"id": "69016", "title": "你好，中校先生", "author": "苏格兰折耳猫", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69016.htm", "intro": "梁和这辈子有两件事出乎她的意料。第一，她会结婚。第二，她会嫁给这样一个男人。\r\n\r\n顾淮宁笑睥着她，眼神笃定：“其实我和梁小 姐一样，都是无意结婚的人。可上天捉弄，我们都是必须结婚的人，所以我觉得，我们两个结婚，是对这个问题最好的解决方法。”\r\n\r\n一桩军婚外加一位高深莫测的中校先生。随之而来的，是一场跨越婚姻围墙的攻坚战。\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 天之骄子 豪门世家", "base": "files/article/html/69/69016", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "10554980.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "10554981.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "10554982.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "10554983.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "10554984.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "10554985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "7", "file": "10554986.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8", "file": "10554987.html", "available": false}, {"title": "9", "file": "10554988.html", "available": false}, {"title": "10", "file": "10554989.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "10554990.html", "available": false}]}